<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero__content">
    <h1 class="hero__title">Deploy web apps from GitHub in minutes</h1>
    <p class="hero__subtitle">
      HelloDeploy is a self-hosted platform that builds, deploys, and manages your
      web applications — with zero vendor lock-in.
    </p>
    <div class="button-group mt-6">
      <a href="/auth/create-account" class="button button--primary button--lg">Get Started</a>
      <a href="/auth/sign-in" class="button button--secondary button--lg">Sign In</a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-4">
      Free to use. This instance is an active pilot operated by Henson Sagorsor as an
      MIT capstone project, running on shared infrastructure — see the <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
      for details. Features and availability may change.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="text-center mt-8">
  <h2 class="feature-title">How it works</h2>
</div>
<div class="feature-grid mt-4">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card__body">
      <p class="feature-icon">1</p>
      <h2 class="feature-title">Connect</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Connect a GitHub repository. HelloDeploy detects the runtime and suggests build settings.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card__body">
      <p class="feature-icon">2</p>
      <h2 class="feature-title">Configure</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Review or adjust the build command, start command, and environment variables.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card__body">
      <p class="feature-icon">3</p>
      <h2 class="feature-title">Deploy</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Push to your production branch, or deploy manually. HelloDeploy builds a container image.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card__body">
      <p class="feature-icon">4</p>
      <h2 class="feature-title">Live</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">HelloDeploy health-checks the new release and routes traffic to it at a live URL.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="feature-grid mt-8">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card__body">
      <p class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'repository' }) %></p>
      <h2 class="feature-title">GitHub integration</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Connect any repository. Push to your production branch and HelloDeploy builds and deploys automatically.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card__body">
      <p class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'deploy' }) %></p>
      <h2 class="feature-title">Live deployment logs</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Watch builds in real time. Roll back to any healthy deployment with a single click.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card__body">
      <p class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'environment' }) %></p>
      <h2 class="feature-title">Encrypted secrets</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Environment variables are encrypted with AES-256-GCM and injected at runtime — never stored in plaintext.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card__body">
      <p class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'domain' }) %></p>
      <h2 class="feature-title">Custom domains</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Point your own domain at any project. DNS verification and admin review keep things secure.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card__body">
      <p class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'users' }) %></p>
      <h2 class="feature-title">Team access</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Invite collaborators as Owner, Maintainer, or Viewer. Transfer ownership when the time comes.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card__body">
      <p class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'audit' }) %></p>
      <h2 class="feature-title">Audit log</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Every deployment, config change, and access event is recorded with actor, IP, and outcome.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="card mt-8">
  <div class="card__body">
    <h2 class="feature-title">What you can deploy</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-2">Version 1 supports:</p>
    <ul class="text-sm text-muted mt-2">
      <li>Static sites</li>
      <li>Node.js applications</li>
      <li>Express applications</li>
      <li>React static builds</li>
      <li>Vue static builds</li>
      <li>Constrained Next.js applications</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-4">
      Not yet supported: Python, PHP, Java, Docker Compose, arbitrary container images, or
      privileged containers.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
